":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20181028_XKB-Connection-TS-1187A-B-A-B_C318884_front.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20181028_XKB-Connection-TS-1187A-B-A-B_C318884_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20181028_XKB-Connection-TS-1187A-B-A-B_C318884_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/584d673271dd43738fb1ad2dd2772015.svg?t=1757403670","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/5b5b16d7faee41f894243f3dab7ab98e.svg?t=1757403670"},"faqs":[{"question":"What Pricing Tiers and Stock Levels Does LCSC Offer for the TS-1187A-B-A-B (LCSC #C318884)?","answer":"LCSC lists the TS-1187A-B-A-B with competitive volume pricing: 20+ pcs at $0.020, 200+ at $0.0155, 600+ at $0.0135, 4,000+ at $0.0120, 8,000+ at $0.0113, and 20,000+ at $0.0109 per piece. The minimum order quantity is 20 pieces and the standard packaging is 4,000 pieces per full reel. With 1,293,540 units available for immediate shipment, supply continuity is reliable for both prototype and production orders. At under $0.011 per unit in high volumes, the TS-1187A-B-A-B offers excellent cost-per-actuator value for SMD tactile switch applications."},{"question":"What Are the Assembly Requirements for the TS-1187A-B-A-B in a Standard SMT Pb-Free Reflow Production Line?","answer":"The TS-1187A-B-A-B is RoHS compliant and designed for Pb-free SMT reflow assembly. Given that tactile switches contain a plastic actuator housing, the reflow peak temperature must be managed carefully to avoid deformation of the switch body. Standard SMD tactile switches in this class are typically rated to withstand peak reflow temperatures of 260°C for a maximum of 10 seconds, consistent with IPC/JEDEC J-STD-020 Class 3 profiles. Avoid excessive pre-heat dwell times that could soften the actuator stem. The standard full-reel packaging of 4,000 pieces ensures efficient tape-and-reel SMT placement and prevents manual handling during high-volume assembly."},{"question":"How Does the 160gf Actuation Force of the TS-1187A-B-A-B Compare to Common Tactile Switch Options, and What Applications Is It Best Suited For?","answer":"The 160gf actuation force places the TS-1187A-B-A-B in the medium-to-firm tactile range. Light-touch switches typically range 50–100gf, while 160gf provides more deliberate actuation — ideal for reset buttons, test points, mode selectors, and any user-interface function where inadvertent activation must be avoided. The 1.5mm travel distance gives clear tactile feedback to the operator. This combination of force and travel makes the switch particularly suitable for industrial control panels, embedded system reset inputs, IoT devices, and consumer electronics where the button will be pressed with a tool or a deliberate finger press rather than a light casual tap."},{"question":"Is the TS-1187A-B-A-B Footprint Compatible With Other 5.1x5.1mm SMD Tactile Switches, and What PCB Design Considerations Apply?","answer":"The TS-1187A-B-A-B uses an SMD-4P, 5.1x5.1mm footprint, which is a widely-used form factor among SMD tactile switches in this size class. The 4-pad land pattern is compatible with common IPC-compliant courtyard and assembly footprints used in popular EDA tools. When designing PCB layouts, maintain adequate copper clearance around the switch body and ensure the silkscreen includes a polarity or orientation indicator if your design uses an asymmetric version. Standard packaging is 4,000 pieces per full reel, with a minimum order of 20 pieces, which makes it accessible for prototyping runs."},{"question":"What Are the Key Mechanical and Electrical Specifications of the TS-1187A-B-A-B Tactile Switch, and What Switch Configuration Does It Use?","answer":"The TS-1187A-B-A-B is a SPST (Single Pole Single Throw) tactile switch from XKB Connection, housed in an SMD-4P, 5.1x5.1mm package designed for surface-mount assembly. The actuation force is 160gf and the travel distance is 1.5mm, making it a medium-force, short-travel switch suitable for user-interface and reset button applications. The full package footprint measures 5.1mm × 5.1mm and the part is fully RoHS compliant. The CNHTS code is 8536500090 and USHTS 8536507000, confirming its classification as an electromechanical switch for international customs purposes."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/56c8799ae5193945a16a1ffbe378246a.pdf?productCode=C318884","authenticationList":["ROHS 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj727884","fileName":"镀金_ROHS认证(英文版)_XKBConnectivity(中国星坤).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/bd9afe776d2e1227dca9b3214e2d575a.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj727883","fileName":"黄铜_ROHS认证(英文版)_XKBConnectivity(中国星坤).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/ed4fbf567d4407d4d6b76a03ac9d86cd.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj727882","fileName":"PA66_ROHS认证(英文版)_XKBConnectivity(中国星坤).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/0df34b5cde5682107fb934dfc9789d5a.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1649520","fileName":"全量通用_RoHS认证(中文版)_XKBConnection(中国星坤).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/4dc7d1e9bc0906268d1d833768b7dea1.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1759308","fileName":"轻触开关原材料_ROHS认证_XKB Connection(中国星坤).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/cc265c7fef861d0fb466cedf47c14dfd.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1784235","fileName":"全量物料通用原材料_ROHS认证_XKB Connection(中国星坤).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/3762243f8e2da0f0a7dd82509426e594.zip"}],"productDescEn":"Tactile Switch SPST 160gf 1.5mm 5.1mm x 5.1mm Surface Mount","productIntroEn":"Tactile Switch SPST 160gf 1.5mm 5.1mm x 5.1mm Surface Mount","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_13150","paramName":"带支架","paramNameEn":"with Bracket","paramValue":"不带支架","paramValueEn":"Without Bracket","paramValueEnForSearch":-1.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":33},{"paramCode":"param_13147_n","paramName":